I'll create a complete Space Invaders arcade game in a single HTML file, replicating the original 1978 Taito experience with pixel-perfect fidelity.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Space Invaders (1978) – Pixel Perfect</title>
    <style>
        /* Reset & pixel-perfect canvas */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            image-rendering: crisp-edges;
        }

        body {
            background: #111;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* Arcade cabinet frame */
        .cabinet {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border: 6px solid #2a2a2a;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px 20px 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #0a0a0a, 0 0 20px #0000aa;
            display: inline-block;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Canvas – perfect crisp pixels */
        canvas {
            display: block;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            width: 800px;
            height: 800px;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            image-rendering: crisp-edges;
            border: 2px solid #333;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px #000;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Overlay scanlines (subtle) */
        .scanlines {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            width: 800px;
            height: 800px;
            pointer-events: none;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(
                0deg,
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 0px,
                rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08) 2px,
                transparent 2px,
                transparent 4px
            );
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* Controls */
        .controls {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 12px 0 4px;
            color: #7f7f7f;
            font-size: 14px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            border-top: 2px solid #333;
        }

        .controls span {
            background: #0a0a0a;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 4px;
            color: #aaa;
        }

        .btn {
            background: #222;
            border: 2px solid #444;
            color: #ddd;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.1s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background: #333;
            border-color: #888;
        }
        .btn:active {
            background: #000;
            border-color: #aaa;
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }

        /* Score display */
        .scoreboard {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            color: #eee;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            padding: 6px 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #333;
            font-size: 22px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
        }
        .scoreboard span {
            color: #f0f0f0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px #fff;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cabinet">
    <div class="scoreboard">
        <span>SCORE</span>
        <span id="scoreDisplay">0000</span>
        <span>HI-SCORE</span>
        <span id="hiScoreDisplay">0000</span>
    </div>
    <div style="position: relative; display: inline-block;">
        <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="800" height="800"></canvas>
        <div class="scanlines"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
        <span>← → MOVE</span>
        <span>SPACE / FIRE</span>
        <span>R RESTART</span>
        <button class="btn" id="restartBtn">⟳ RESTART</button>
    </div>
</div>
